          <p>Find the right treatment. Understand your insurance. Connect with the right clinic.</p>
          <a href="https://instagram.com/chimai0403" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@chimai0403 on Instagram</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h5>Browse</h5>
          <a href="/#directory">Treatments</a>
          <a href="/pilates">Clinics</a>
          <a href="/#categories">Categories</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h5>Resources</h5>
          <a href="/#resources">Guides</a>
          <a href="/#insurance">Insurance</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h5>Company</h5>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="https://instagram.com/chimai0403" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-bottom">Wellness coverage can vary by insurer, plan, and provider. These are personal discoveries and community recommendations — not guarantees of coverage. Always check with your insurer before booking. This directory is for informational purposes only.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="js/app.js"></script>
